    skos:note "(Albania) Forest land - Besides the forests according to the FAO definition, also areas where trees should not be able to reach a minimum height of 5 m at maturity and bare/rocky terrain, eroded and abandoned/refused lands are classified as the forest land. http://www.fris.sk/Phare/Projects/ManagementOfForestInEurope/PDF/annex2.pdf"@en .

