    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Australia-Tasmania 1985) \"forest\" means an area containing trees; Forest Practices Act 1985 - Sect 3. http://www.austlii.edu.au/au/legis/tas/consol_act/fpa1985183/s3.html"@en .

