    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Canada) - The conversion of non-forested land to forested land through human activities, on land that was forested but that had been converted to non-forested land. http://carbon.cfs.nrcan.gc.ca/definitions_e.html"@en .

