    skos:note "(Croatia KP) forest is land spanning more than 0.1 hectares with trees higher than 2 meters and canopy cover more than 10 percent, or trees able to reach these thresholds in situ, http://books.google.com/books?id=iU6ctBak3-gC&pg=PA132&lpg=PA132&dq=Croatia++Forest++definition+define+%22forest+is%22+law&source=bl&ots=yvf2xQpJPr&sig=mQUVqbZLIEa6C88qGsh1mYS9UDY&hl=en&sa=X&ei=SoI6T_26K4Tg0QGAmoHFCw&ved=0CCMQ6AEwAA#v=onepage&q=Croatia%20%20Forest%20%20definition%20define%20%22forest%20is%22%20law&f=false"@en .

