    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasCriteria ex:Def_def_den_1998_1009_criteria ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Denmark 1998) More than 0.5 ha, broader than 30 m, covered by tree-species which are or is able to be more that 6 m's in height. (From: PMP@sns.dk Date: Tue, 29 Sep 1998 09:31:59 +0100). Note: at first glance this appears to be a land cover description, but subsequent definitions of afforestation and reforestation for Denmark show that \"forest\" is really a land use term."@en .

