    skos:note "(Denmark) the basic definition of a forest is that the forest area must be minimum 0.5 ha. There is no specific guideline on the crown cover or the height of the trees http://www2.dmu.dk/1_viden/2_publikationer/3_arbrapporter/rapporter/ar211.pdf"@en .

