    skos:note "(Estonia 1998) Forest Act (FA) (1998) forest is defined as a site of woody vegetation with an area of at least 0,5 ha which meets at least one of the following criteria: 1) the height of the trees is at least 1,3 m and the canopy density at least 30 per cent; 2) it is managed for obtaining timber or other forest produce, or woody vegetation is maintained there for the use in the ways specified in this Act. http://www.keskkonnainfo.ee/publications/16285_PDF.pdf"@en .

