ex:Def_def_est_1999_1498 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Estonia 1999) Forest land [metsamaa] - Land that is assigned for growing ligneo..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Estonia ;
    ex:country "Estonia" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Estonia 1999) Forest land [metsamaa] - Land that is assigned for growing ligneous plants (by land survey or by land cadastre). Other lands that have importance for forestry can also be assigned into forest land if these are not suitable for other category. Current Estonian Forestry Act (valid until 01/01/99) From: \"Sulev Svilponis\" Sulev@ekm.envir.ee. Definitions are unofficial translations."@en .

