    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Estonia) Forest [mets] - forest land with plant community. Trees, bushes and other plants are important part of forest. Forest fauna is part of forest ecosystem. Current Estonian Forestry Act (valid until 01/01/99) From: \"Sulev Svilponis\" Sulev@ekm.envir.ee. Definitions are unofficial translations."@en .

