ex:Def_def_ind_2005_114 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(India 2005) - ‘forest’ means ‘any land covered with trees and undergrowth and i..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_India ;
    ex:country "India" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Cover" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(India 2005) - ‘forest’ means ‘any land covered with trees and undergrowth and includes all statutorily recognised forests, whether designated as reserve, protected or otherwise, and any land recorded as forests in the government records irrespective of the owners.’ India 2005. http://www.thehindu.com/2009/05/12/stories/2009051252140500.htm"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2005_858 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(India 2005) - ‘forest’ means ‘any land covered with trees and undergrowth and i..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_India ;
    ex:country "India" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Cover" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(India 2005) - ‘forest’ means ‘any land covered with trees and undergrowth and includes all statutorily recognised forests, whether designated as reserve, protected or otherwise, and any land recorded as forests in the government records irrespective of the owners.’ India 2005. http://www.thehindu.com/2009/05/12/stories/2009051252140500.htm"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2007_115 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(India 2007 Proposed) MoEF has proposed a definition that says forest is “an are..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_India ;
    ex:country "India" ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(India 2007 Proposed) MoEF has proposed a definition that says forest is “an area under Government control notified or recorded as forest under any Act, for conservation and management of ecological and biological resources.” http://www.mtnforum.org/sites/default/files/pub/4946.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2007_339 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(India 2007) \"Forest land\" means land of any description falling within any fore..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_India ;
    ex:country "India" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(India 2007) \"Forest land\" means land of any description falling within any forest area and includes unclassified forests, undermarcated forests, existing or deemed forests, protected forests, reserved forests, Sanctuaries and National Parks; https://tribal.nic.in/FRA/data/FRARulesBook.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2009_1061 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Indonesia 2009) Forest means a unity of ecosystem in the form of land consistin..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Indonesia ;
    ex:country "Indonesia" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Indonesia 2009) Forest means a unity of ecosystem in the form of land consisting of biological resources dominated by trees in their natural form and environment, in which one and another are inseparable. https://www.elaw.org/system/files/REDD_PERMENHUT_P-30-2009_BILINGUAL.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2009_120 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Indonesia 2009). Forest area means a certain area designated and or stipulated ..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Indonesia ;
    ex:country "Indonesia" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Indonesia 2009). Forest area means a certain area designated and or stipulated by the government to preserve its existence as a permanent forest. https://www.elaw.org/system/files/REDD_PERMENHUT_P-30-2009_BILINGUAL.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2009_396 a ex:Definition ;
