    skos:note "(Malaysia) - An ecosystem with a minimum of 10 percent crown cover of trees and / or bamboos, generally associated with wild flora, fauna and natural soil conditions, and not subject to agricultural practices. This definition is also applied to the term \"forest land\". From: hcthang@forestry.gov.my (Thang Hooi Chiew), Forestry Department Peninsular Malaysia"@en .

