    skos:note "(Norway) For the purpose of this Act, «forest land» means land which produces forest 2) or which on an overall farming- and forestry assessment is considered to be most suitable for forest production and is not being used for any other purpose. http://odin.dep.no/ld/engelsk/dep/020001-200002/index-dok000-b-n-a.html"@en .

