    skos:note "(Pakistan) To remove, kill or destroy all or most of the trees of a forest so that reproduction is impossible except by artificial means. Definition adopted from the British Commonwealth Forest Terminology Part-I, 1953. Source: Mumtaz Ahmad, Section Forest Officer, Pakistan Min. of Environment, Local Government, and Rural Development."@en .

