    skos:note "(Poland? 1991) Forest Act of 28 September 1991. (OJ 1991 No 101 item. 444) for the forest land is considered a homogeneous area of at least 0.10 ha, which is covered by forest vegetation (forest crop), i.e. trees, shrubs and forest undergrowth or temporarily deprived of that what is intended for forest production(…) (Forest Act, 1991). http://icaci.org/documents/ICC_proceedings/ICC2011/Oral%20Presentations%20PDF/A3-Data%20integration/CO-028.pdf"@en .

