ex:Def_def_por_1994_1484 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Portugal 1994) - According to minimum tree densities which vary from species to..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Portugal ;
    ex:country "Portugal" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Cover" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasCriteria ex:Def_def_por_1994_1484_criteria ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Portugal 1994) - According to minimum tree densities which vary from species to species (as low as 90/ha for cork oak, up to 840 for most conifers) with conifer heights from 1.5-5m hand broadleaf heights from 2-5m; or where the projected area of crowns of trees more than 5m height covers more than 15% of the ground areas. This rather complicated definition is necessary to define when grant payments are applicable and is necessary because Portugal has a long agroforestry tradition. (decree 199/94) From: Gerry Lawson <gjl@ite.ac.uk"@en .

ex:Def_def_por_1994_1484_criteria ex:minCanopyCover "15.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minCanopyCoverSI "15.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeight "5.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeightSI "5.0"^^xsd:float .

ex:Def_def_por_1994_270 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Portugal 1994) - According to minimum tree densities which vary from species to..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Portugal ;
    ex:country "Portugal" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Cover" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasCriteria ex:Def_def_por_1994_270_criteria ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Portugal 1994) - According to minimum tree densities which vary from species to species (as low as 90/ha for cork oak, up to 840 for most conifers) with conifer heights from 1.5-5m hand broadleaf heights from 2-5m; or where the projected area of crowns of trees more than 5m height covers more than 15% of the ground areas. This rather complicated definition is necessary to define when grant payments are applicable and is necessary because Portugal has a long agroforestry tradition. (decree 199/94) From: Gerry Lawson <gjl@ite.ac.uk"@en .

ex:Def_def_por_1994_270_criteria ex:minCanopyCover "15.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minCanopyCoverSI "15.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeight "5.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeightSI "5.0"^^xsd:float .

