ex:Def_def_sou_2084_402 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(South Africa ) Under the Forest Act, not only does the definition of forest inc..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_South_Africa ;
    ex:country "South Africa" ;
    ex:definitionType "Administrative" ;
    ex:geographicScope "International" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_UN-FAO ;
    skos:note "(South Africa ) Under the Forest Act, not only does the definition of forest include all biological organisms, it also includes the desire to “do anything in a state forest for which a licence is required” (which could apply to hunting) (sec. 29). http://www.fao.org/legal/prs-ol/lpo%2084.pdf"@en .

