    skos:note "In England this means a wood with no coppiced trees, often conifer Plantations. Traditionally meant a hunting ground or 'chase' Nature Conservation Glossary http://www.wildlifetrust.org.uk/suffolk/redgrave/glossary.htm"@en .

ex:Def_def_uk_unknown_825 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Small Islands) Forest is defined as land with tree crown cover of more than 10 ..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_UK ;
