    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Isle of Man 1984) - The term \"forest\" only appears in the Forestry Act 1984, where it is not defined. The context of its usage means a large woodland. \"IOM Gov DAFF\" <daff@gov.im"@en .

