ex:Def_def_unk_2006_1376 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Russian Federation 2006) Статья 5. Понятие леса - Использование, охрана, защита..." ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological" ;
    ex:geographicScope "International" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Russian Federation 2006) Статья 5. Понятие леса - Использование, охрана, защита, воспроизводство лесов осуществляются исходя из понятия о лесе как об экологической системе или как о природном ресурсе. Article 5. Definition of forest Utilization, protection, conservation and reforestation are carried out based on understanding forests as an ecological system or a natural resource. From Yelena Gordeeva, 3 June 2015. yelena.gordeeva@uhasselt.be See also http://www.fire.uni-freiburg.de/GlobalNetworks/BalticRegion/ForestCode-3rdReading-061108-eng.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_unk_2006_1461 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Taiwan 2006) Forestland as used in Paragraph 1, Article 3 of this Act is define..." ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "Local/State" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Taiwan 2006) Forestland as used in Paragraph 1, Article 3 of this Act is defined as follows: 1. A land designated for forestry purpose under Article 3 of the Non-Urban Land Use and Control Rules and land subject to forestland control under Article 7 of the same Rules; 2. A land in a non-urban land area not subject to zoning, and land in an urban planning preservation, scenery and agricultural areas determined as forestland by the competent authorities of a province-level municipality or county/city government; 3. A land designated as conservation land under this Act; 4. A land used for forest recreation area in accordance with Article 17 of this Act; and 5. A land deemed located in a national park area under the National Park Law and determined as forestland by the competent authorities in consultation with the competent authority of the national park. http://law.moj.gov.tw/PDAENG/NewsContent.aspx?msgid=2429"@en .

ex:Def_def_unk_2006_147 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Taiwan 2006) Forestland as used in Paragraph 1, Article 3 of this Act is define..." ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "Local/State" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "(Taiwan 2006) Forestland as used in Paragraph 1, Article 3 of this Act is defined as follows: 1. A land designated for forestry purpose under Article 3 of the Non-Urban Land Use and Control Rules and land subject to forestland control under Article 7 of the same Rules; 2. A land in a non-urban land area not subject to zoning, and land in an urban planning preservation, scenery and agricultural areas determined as forestland by the competent authorities of a province-level municipality or county/city government; 3. A land designated as conservation land under this Act; 4. A land used for forest recreation area in accordance with Article 17 of this Act; and 5. A land deemed located in a national park area under the National Park Law and determined as forestland by the competent authorities in consultation with the competent authority of the national park. http://law.moj.gov.tw/PDAENG/NewsContent.aspx?msgid=2429"@en .

