    skos:note "(Kirbati 2010) At the regional level forest is defined as; ‘trees that have a certain size of canopy, they are not agricultural and are not located in urban areas’. http://www.sprep.org/att/irc/ecopies/countries/kiribati/115.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_unk_2010_966 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(Rwanda 2010) An ecosystem dominated by trees (defined as perennial woody plants..." ;
