    skos:note "(Rwanda 2010) An ecosystem dominated by trees (defined as perennial woody plants taller than 5 meters at maturity), where the tree crown cover (or equivalent stocking level) exceeds 10% of the ground surface and the area is larger than 0.5ha. http://rnra.rw/uploads/media/Forestry_Sector_Strategic_Plan.pdf"@en .

