    skos:note "(Czech Republic1995) Afforestation shall mean the establishment of forest stand, http://www.uhul.cz/images/ke_stazeni/legislativa_jazyky/Lesni_zakon_en.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_unk_unknown_1388 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Generally refers to the planting of trees on ground where trees have never exist..." ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    skos:note "Generally refers to the planting of trees on ground where trees have never existed or were last present hundreds of years ago. Afforestation carbon offset projects bear an additional burden of showing ecological compatibility. http://www.usask.ca/agriculture/caedac/dbases/glossary.htm and http://www.undp.org/seed/forest/pdf/InnovatForesFinanc.pdf."@en .

