    skos:note "(Taiwan, ROC) Forest land - the land that is at least 0.5 hectare in size with at least 10% of the area covered with tree crowns or commercial bamboo, the forest belt beside road or river is at least 50 meters wide. The road, river, other water area or open lands in forest is less than 20 meters wide. The open land over than 0.5 hectare which is considered to reforestation or afforestation. Source: The Third Forest Resources and Land Use Inventory in Taiwan&uml; - \"&ordf;L&deg;È&sect;&frac12;service\" service@dns.forest.gov.tw"@en .

